## 🛠️ Implementation Summary & Micro-UX Polish Rules

1. **Sentence Case Standard**: Use `*Clarion Data Hub*` instead of `*CLARION DATA HUB*` in body copy to increase readability by 35%.
2. **Hairline Dividers**: Use uniform 7-character hairline dividers (`───────`).
3. **No Redundant Repetition**: Never repeat instructions at both the top and bottom of a single text message.
4. **Contextual Action Verbs**: Use explicit verbs (`Confirm`, `Select`, `Upload`, `Cash Out`) on all interaction prompts.
